<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Techfest, IIT Bombay — An Aetherial Renaissance</title>
<meta name="description" content="Concept redesign of the Techfest, IIT Bombay landing page — Asia's largest science and technology festival." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --void:#07060a;
    --void-2:#100e1a;
    --gold:#d1a85c;
    --gold-bright:#e9c583;
    --violet:#8073b8;
    --rose:#b6566a;
    --parchment:#eee7d8;
    --ink-soft:rgba(238,231,216,.68);
    --line:rgba(238,231,216,.14);
    --serif:'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    --sans:'Sora', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --wrap:1180px;
  }
  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--void);
    color:var(--parchment);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  ::selection{ background:var(--gold); color:#1a1508; }
  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  img,svg{ max-width:100%; display:block; }
  .wrap{ max-width:var(--wrap); margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px; }
  section{ position:relative; }

  h1,h2,h3{ font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:500; margin:0; }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-weight:500;
    font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--gold-bright);
    margin:0 0 14px 0;
  }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  .nav{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:22px 32px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,6,10,.85), rgba(7,6,10,0));
    backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
  }
  .nav .brand{
    font-family:var(--serif); font-weight:600; font-size:1.35rem; letter-spacing:.02em;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px;
  }
  .nav .brand .dot{ width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 0 10px 2px var(--gold); }
  .nav ul{ list-style:none; display:flex; gap:34px; margin:0; padding:0; }
  .nav a.link{ font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); transition:color .25s; position:relative; }
  .nav a.link:hover{ color:var(--parchment); }
  .nav a.link::after{
    content:''; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:-6px; width:0; height:1px; background:var(--gold);
    transition:width .25s;
  }
  .nav a.link:hover::after{ width:100%; }
  .nav .cta{
    font-size:.88rem; font-weight:600; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:100px;
    border:1px solid var(--gold); color:var(--gold-bright);
    transition:background .25s, color .25s;
  }
  .nav .cta:hover{ background:var(--gold); color:#1a1508; }
  .nav .menu-btn{ display:none; }
  @media (max-width:880px){
    .nav ul{ display:none; }
    .nav .cta{ display:none; }
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(128,115,184,.22), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(209,168,92,.12), transparent 60%),
      var(--void);
  }
  #stars{ position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0; }
  .astrolabe{
    position:absolute; z-index:1;
    top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    width:min(78vw, 820px); height:min(78vw, 820px);
    opacity:.55;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .astrolabe .ring-outer{ animation:spin 140s linear infinite; transform-origin:400px 400px; }
  .astrolabe .ring-inner{ animation:spin 90s linear infinite reverse; transform-origin:400px 400px; }
  @keyframes spin{ to{ transform:rotate(360deg); } }

  .hero-content{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    text-align:center;
    max-width:820px; padding:0 24px;
    animation:rise 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both;
  }
  @keyframes rise{ from{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); } to{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  .hero-content .eyebrow{ font-size:1.1rem; }
  .hero-content h1{
    font-style:italic; font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6.4rem);
    line-height:1.02;
    background:linear-gradient(100deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--parchment) 45%, var(--violet) 90%);
    -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;
  }
  .hero-content .sub{
    margin:26px auto 0; max-width:46ch;
    font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .hero-actions{ display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; margin-top:40px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .btn{
    font-family:var(--sans); font-weight:600; font-size:.94rem;
    padding:14px 28px; border-radius:100px; cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .2s, background .25s, color .25s, border-color .25s;
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .btn:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-solid{ background:var(--gold); color:#1a1508; border:1px solid var(--gold); }
  .btn-solid:hover{ background:var(--gold-bright); }
  .btn-ghost{ background:transparent; color:var(--parchment); border:1px solid var(--line); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color:var(--gold); color:var(--gold-bright); }

  .hero-stats{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:48px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:70px; padding-top:26px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:.88rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .hero-stats strong{ color:var(--gold-bright); font-family:var(--serif); font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:600; margin-right:6px; }

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about{ padding:150px 0 130px; }
  .about-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr; gap:70px; align-items:start; }
  .about h2{ font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3.6vw,3rem); font-style:italic; line-height:1.14; max-width:14ch; }
  .about p{ margin-top:22px; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.75; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:52ch; }
  .stat-col{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:34px; }
  .stat-row{ border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:20px; }
  .stat-row .num{
    font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.4rem); color:var(--gold-bright); line-height:1;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .stat-row .label{ margin-top:8px; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  @media (max-width:820px){ .about-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- pillars ---------- */
  .pillars{ padding:60px 0 140px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .pillars .head{ max-width:640px; margin-bottom:70px; }
  .pillars .head h2{ font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3.6vw,3rem); font-style:italic; }
  .pillar{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:64px 1fr auto; gap:28px; align-items:center;
    padding:34px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pillar:last-child{ border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .pillar .icon{ width:44px; height:44px; color:var(--gold); }
  .pillar h3{ font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,1.9rem); font-style:italic; font-weight:500; }
  .pillar p{ margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.98rem; max-width:52ch; line-height:1.6; }
  .pillar .tag{ font-size:.82rem; color:var(--violet); white-space:nowrap; font-weight:600; }
  @media (max-width:700px){
    .pillar{ grid-template-columns:44px 1fr; }
    .pillar .tag{ grid-column:2; margin-top:6px; }
  }

  /* ---------- theme ---------- */
  .theme{
    padding:140px 0; text-align:center;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--void) 0%, var(--void-2) 50%, var(--void) 100%);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .theme .divider{ width:220px; margin:0 auto 46px; opacity:.7; }
  .theme blockquote{
    margin:0 auto; max-width:800px;
    font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem); line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--parchment);
  }
  .theme blockquote em{ color:var(--gold-bright); font-style:italic; }
  .theme cite{ display:block; margin-top:30px; font-style:normal; font-size:.85rem; color:var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ---------- timeline ---------- */
  .timeline{ padding:140px 0; }
  .timeline .head{ max-width:640px; margin-bottom:64px; }
  .timeline .head h2{ font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3.6vw,3rem); font-style:italic; }
  .days{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:var(--line); border:1px solid var(--line); }
  .day{ background:var(--void); padding:38px 32px; }
  .day .no{ font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; color:var(--gold-bright); font-size:.98rem; }
  .day h3{ margin-top:14px; font-size:1.5rem; font-style:italic; font-weight:500; }
  .day p{ margin-top:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.65; }
  @media (max-width:780px){ .days{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- voices marquee ---------- */
  .voices{ padding:100px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); overflow:hidden; }
  .voices .head{ text-align:center; margin-bottom:50px; }
  .marquee{ overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap; }
  .marquee-track{
    display:inline-flex; gap:52px; align-items:center;
    animation:scroll-left 38s linear infinite;
    padding-right:52px;
  }
  .marquee.reverse .marquee-track{ animation:scroll-right 44s linear infinite; }
  .marquee:hover .marquee-track{ animation-play-state:paused; }
  @keyframes scroll-left{ from{ transform:translateX(0); } to{ transform:translateX(-50%); } }
  @keyframes scroll-right{ from{ transform:translateX(-50%); } to{ transform:translateX(0); } }
  .marquee span{
    font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2.1rem);
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .marquee span.sep{ color:var(--gold); font-style:normal; opacity:.7; }
  .marquee.row2 span{ color:rgba(238,231,216,.32); }

  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
  .cta-band{
    margin:0 32px 32px; border-radius:28px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--gold-bright) 45%, var(--violet) 130%);
    color:#1a1508;
    padding:90px 60px; text-align:center;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cta-band h2{ font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.4vw,3.6rem); font-style:italic; max-width:16ch; margin:0 auto; }
  .cta-band p{ margin:20px auto 40px; max-width:48ch; font-size:1.05rem; color:rgba(26,21,8,.75); }
  .cta-band .btn-solid{ background:#1a1508; color:var(--gold-bright); border-color:#1a1508; }
  .cta-band .btn-solid:hover{ background:#282013; }
  @media (max-width:700px){ .cta-band{ padding:60px 28px; margin:0 16px 16px; } }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{ padding:70px 0 40px; }
  .foot-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:40px; padding-bottom:50px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .foot-grid h4{ font-family:var(--sans); font-size:.82rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--gold-bright); margin:0 0 16px; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .foot-grid .brand{ font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-size:1.6rem; }
  .foot-grid p{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.92rem; line-height:1.6; max-width:32ch; margin-top:14px; }
  .foot-grid ul{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px; }
  .foot-grid a{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.92rem; transition:color .2s; }
  .foot-grid a:hover{ color:var(--gold-bright); }
  .foot-bottom{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;
    padding-top:26px; font-size:.8rem; color:rgba(238,231,216,.4);
  }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .foot-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }

  /* ---------- reveal (single-use, stat counters only) ---------- */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{ scroll-behavior:auto; }
    .astrolabe .ring-outer, .astrolabe .ring-inner, .marquee-track, .hero-content{ animation:none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#" class="brand"><span class="dot"></span>Techfest</a>
  <ul>
    <li><a class="link" href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a class="link" href="#whats-on">What's on</a></li>
    <li><a class="link" href="#theme">Theme</a></li>
    <li><a class="link" href="#schedule">Schedule</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#register" class="cta">Register</a>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <canvas id="stars"></canvas>
  <svg class="astrolabe" viewBox="0 0 800 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <g class="ring-outer" stroke="#d1a85c" fill="none" stroke-width="1">
      <circle cx="400" cy="400" r="360" opacity="0.55"/>
      <circle cx="400" cy="400" r="330" opacity="0.3"/>
      <g opacity="0.6">
        <!-- tick marks -->
        <g id="ticksA"></g>
      </g>
      <path d="M60,400 A340,150 0 0 1 740,400" opacity="0.35"/>
      <path d="M60,400 A340,150 0 0 0 740,400" opacity="0.35"/>
    </g>
    <g class="ring-inner" stroke="#8073b8" fill="none" stroke-width="1">
      <circle cx="400" cy="400" r="250" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="400" cy="400" r="205" opacity="0.35"/>
      <path d="M400,150 L400,650 M150,400 L650,400" opacity="0.3"/>
      <circle cx="400" cy="150" r="5" fill="#e9c583" stroke="none"/>
      <circle cx="620" cy="290" r="3" fill="#eee7d8" stroke="none"/>
      <circle cx="230" cy="560" r="3" fill="#eee7d8" stroke="none"/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Techfest, IIT Bombay — 29th edition</p>
    <h1>An Aetherial<br/>Renaissance</h1>
    <p class="sub">Three days where a thousand years of curiosity meet the machines of tomorrow. Asia's largest science and technology festival, run entirely by students, this December at IIT Bombay.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#register" class="btn btn-solid">Register now</a>
      <a href="#whats-on" class="btn btn-ghost">See what's on</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stats wrap">
    <div><strong>29</strong>years running</div>
    <div><strong>1.8L+</strong>festival footfall</div>
    <div><strong>2,500+</strong>colleges reached</div>
    <div><strong>500+</strong>international universities</div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The idea</p>
      <h2>Where the old questions get new machines</h2>
      <p>Started in 1998 as a way for Indian students to build and show their work, Techfest has grown into the subcontinent's largest gathering of makers, researchers and the tech-curious. It's organised end to end by the student community of IIT Bombay, under the patronage of UNESCO and UNICEF, and it happens once a year, over one long weekend in December.</p>
      <p>Past editions have hosted A.P.J. Abdul Kalam, the ISRO chairman, a Google Maps co-founder and Sophia the robot — alongside thousands of students who came to compete, build, and stay up too late arguing about robotics.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-col">
      <div class="stat-row"><div class="num">1998</div><div class="label">The year it began</div></div>
      <div class="stat-row"><div class="num">3 days</div><div class="label">Lectures, competitions, exhibitions, and one very loud night segment</div></div>
      <div class="stat-row"><div class="num">2</div><div class="label">UN patrons — UNESCO and UNICEF</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pillars" id="whats-on">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What's on</p>
      <h2>Six ways to spend three days here</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M24 6L38 14V30L24 42L10 30V14L24 6Z"/><circle cx="24" cy="22" r="6"/></svg>
      <div><h3>Lectures</h3><p>Scientists, astronauts, founders and the occasional humanoid robot, on stage to talk about what they're building and why it matters.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">Main stage</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><rect x="8" y="10" width="14" height="14"/><rect x="26" y="24" width="14" height="14"/><path d="M15 24V38M33 10V24M22 17H26"/></svg>
      <div><h3>Competitions</h3><p>Robowars, hackathons, and design challenges that pull teams from over 500 international universities onto the same floor.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">International</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M8 34L18 14L28 30L34 18L40 34"/><circle cx="18" cy="14" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
      <div><h3>Workshops</h3><p>Hands-on sessions in AI, robotics and deep learning, taught by people who work on this for a living, not just talk about it.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">Hands-on</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><rect x="6" y="12" width="36" height="24" rx="1"/><path d="M6 20H42M16 12V8M32 12V8"/></svg>
      <div><h3>Exhibitions</h3><p>A tech expo of robotics, aerospace and defence hardware you'd otherwise only see behind glass, or not at all.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">Tech expo</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M12 40V22C12 14 17 8 24 8C31 8 36 14 36 22V40"/><path d="M6 40H42"/></svg>
      <div><h3>Technoholix</h3><p>The night segment — concerts and light shows that turn the campus into something closer to a festival ground than a lecture hall.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">After dark</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M8 30C14 18 20 34 24 22C28 10 34 26 40 16" /></svg>
      <div><h3>Ozone</h3><p>An avenue for international street artists — the one corner of Techfest that has nothing to do with circuits.</p></div>
      <div class="tag">Street arts</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="theme" id="theme">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg class="divider" viewBox="0 0 220 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1="0" y1="12" x2="80" y2="12" stroke="#d1a85c" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6"/>
      <circle cx="110" cy="12" r="4" fill="#d1a85c"/>
      <circle cx="94" cy="8" r="1.6" fill="#8073b8"/>
      <circle cx="128" cy="17" r="1.6" fill="#8073b8"/>
      <line x1="140" y1="12" x2="220" y2="12" stroke="#d1a85c" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.6"/>
    </svg>
    <blockquote>
      Aether was the ancients' name for the substance of the heavens — the thing stars were made of, before anyone knew what stars were made of. Renaissance was what happened when that same curiosity turned back toward the earth and started building. <em>This year, we put the two in one room.</em>
      <cite>— Techfest 2026 theme note</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="timeline" id="schedule">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The shape of it</p>
      <h2>Three days, roughly</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="days">
      <div class="day">
        <p class="no">Day one</p>
        <h3>Arrival &amp; opening</h3>
        <p>Campus opens, registrations close, and the inaugural lecture sets the tone for the weekend. Exhibitions open in the evening.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <p class="no">Day two</p>
        <h3>The core of it</h3>
        <p>Competitions run through the day across every ground on campus, workshops fill up fast, and Technoholix takes over after dark.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <p class="no">Day three</p>
        <h3>Finals &amp; finale</h3>
        <p>Competition finals, closing lectures, and a last night that's louder than the first. Prizes, then the long walk back to the hostel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="voices">
  <div class="wrap head">
    <p class="eyebrow">On record</p>
    <h2 style="font-style:italic; font-size:clamp(2rem,3.4vw,2.8rem);">Past voices on this stage</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="marquee">
    <div class="marquee-track" id="track1"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="marquee row2 reverse" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <div class="marquee-track" id="track2"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band-wrap">
  <div class="cta-band" id="register">
    <h2>Be part of the next edition</h2>
    <p>Registrations open a few months out and fill up fast, especially for the flagship competitions. Leave your details and we'll tell you the moment they're live.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-solid">Notify me</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="brand">Techfest</div>
